1. Timeline & Interactive Preview
Visual Timeline Interface: Add a timeline style view to make cuts easy to see and allow precise manual adjustments once previewing is enabled.
Word & Silence Duration Editing: Allow previewing and inline editing for individual word lengths and silence durations directly on the timeline.
Video-Editor Style Final Preview: Implement a main compiler preview system leveraging standard video editor preview methods for smooth playback.

2. Smart Cutting & Audio Bleeping
Custom Cut Threshold: Add a configurable padding/threshold option for cuts to maintain natural spacing and breathing room between edits.
Targeted Word Bleeping: Add an option to automatically detect and bleep every instance of a specific word across the audio/video.

3. Audio Processing & Export Options
Audio Processing Statistics: Display end-of-process metrics for applied effects, including Noise Reduction, Compressor, and Loudness Normalization.
Conditional Preset Controls: Update the Loudness Normalization UI so target platforms (e.g., YouTube, Spotify, Broadcast) are optional. Automatically disable or hide these presets when Loudness Normalization is toggled off.

4. Intelligence & AI Enhancements
Contextual Filler Word Detection: Upgrade filler word detection from a static keyword list to an AI contextual model that accurately identifies whether a word is acting as a filler based on context.
